llpapers for use.\n\n----Functions at a glance ----\nSummon models\nChange the texture of walls, etc.\nVisit other users' rooms\nCheck your own data\nLog in\nSwitch windows\nChange weather\nChange background music\nSave Room\nLoad Room\nVolume control\nChange language\n\n---Controls ----\nMove with the left controller stick.\nRotate with the right controller stick.\nThe upper trigger on the right controller controls the menu panel.\n\n When you open the menu panel of a model and select a model: \n You can summon & hold the model with the upper trigger on the right controller.\n Press A on the right controller to zoom in and out.\n Press B on the right controller to rotate the model.\n Delete a model with the lower trigger of the right controller.\n When you move the model while holding the model, the model will move.\n (More detailed explanation can be found at \"https://xrsns.org/\")\n\n---Special thanks---\nBGM: (C) K.Y., (C) L-side, (C) Sound Effect Lab\nModel: (C) MASAYOSHI, (C) Dimensiva, (C) 3D Shaker\nImage: (C) Pixabay\n", "short_description": "XR Designer is a VR game that allows you to design and share rooms.\nYou can visit rooms created by others, or upload your own models and wallpapers for use."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "coverArt_1080x360px.png", "id": "9546402602098530", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240095_9546402608765196_4519594928395556476_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zoVLTGyrlrYQ7kNvwE4288H&_nc_oc=AdnGQOBJFP4NQGyMcQ1vgJYXlDzW9FnfAFfkqdU3mdy-DNkxa794etftd08X-8abBAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvgkJtnsGt0W4ByXwotifAQtj3QU_H1ePo_10NOwo6BCg&oe=699995A1"}, {"file_name": "coverArt_1008x1440px.png", "id": "6317703311616142", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003237_6317703314949475_8763368581178911583_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nndd5LsY-